组件的原 ZIP 指纹见 components；解压后可复算 component_trees。逐文件 SHA-256、两个空格、组件内相对路径和换行，按路径 UTF-8 字节升序拼接后再求 SHA-256。

Upstream archive fingerprints are listed under components. The component_trees values hash UTF-8 lines sorted by relative path bytes, each with file SHA-256, two spaces, the path within its component and LF.
